From 8e0f22c152dfa0880fdfa826f812d8c4026e42db Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Devin <devin@cognition.ai>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 23:06:01 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] L1: thin-suite fills (~59 tests)

GstUtilsFillTests: GetCaps format branch matrix (MPEG-TS, ISO BMFF,
MP3, AAC variants, AC3/EC3/Atmos, AC4, H.264, HEVC, MPEG-2, TTML,
WebVTT, MP4, unknown/invalid).

GstHandlerControlFillTests: enable/disable, ScopeHelper move
semantics, handler completion, timeout paths, concurrent waiters.

OcdmBasicDecryptFillTests: decrypt error-code passthrough,
terminateEarly on failure, HDCP gate skipping the memory system,
zero-size payload, IV propagation, serialized repeat calls.

VttCueFillTests: VTTCue value-type field assignment across boundary
inputs (zero/negative times, empty/long/UTF-8 text, settings).

DrmSecureClient and PluginsTests are intentionally not extended: the
former is fully gated behind SEC_CLIENT_HEADERS which are absent, and
the decryptor plugin sources are static-heavy/uncompiled in that
binary, so no meaningful always-on coverage exists there.
